  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-23T14:29:17.780Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm going to be very blunt: I don't like the default fallback avatars, at all. It's just so jarring to see random people with trashcans for heads, or giant creepy bananas. And now it's very hard to tell at a glance whose avatars I need to show (I know the nameplate shows Fallback now but that's ONLY if I have the quick menu open).\nPlease add an option to display fallback robots instead of the default fallback avatars for those who haven't uploaded a custom fallback avatar.",
